* Original Schmitt initial in-band IC: reversed-ic1
Vd d 0 PWL(0 2.15 4n 2.15 5n 5 8n 5 9n 2.15 13n 2.15 14n 0 17n 0 18n 2.15 20n 2.15)
.model ADC adc_schmitt(in_low=2.2 in_high=2.1 rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n time_tol=0 out_low=0 out_high=5 clamp_low=0 clamp_high=5 clamp_res=10 clamp_bias=.5 ic=1 out_family="HC")
.model DAC dac_bridge(in_family="HC" out_low=0 out_high=5 g_pullup=.024 g_pulldown=.034 g_hiz=1e-9 g_resistive=.001 input_load=0 t_rise=100p t_fall=100p knee_low=2 knee_high=2.75 v_smooth=.5)
Aadc d din ADC
Adac din q DAC
